Aim: To replace a substring in a given string.

Algorithm:
1. Start.
2. Declare a string.
3. Specify the old and new strings.
4. Use replace().
5. Display the modified string.
6. Stop.

class Replace {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String s="Hello Java";
        System.out.println(s.replace("Java","World"));
    }
}
